{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026aofYAS42CX1795415660.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>葉蒨文（Sophie）近日於社交平台公開多張台慶當晚於電視城戶外噴水池旁拍攝的造型美照，向粉絲大派福利！從公開的相片可見，葉蒨文當晚以一襲純白色掛頸晚裝長裙華麗登場，在夜色與燈光映照下盡顯高貴優雅的女神風範。</p><p><p><img alt=\"284d76f2-ff0f-46e8-bf6a-e74ae0b5b33d.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20264N2xWLV7l11795415659.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>這套純白戰衣設計極具心思，可謂「前後皆有睇頭」！正面心口位置採用性感鏤空剪裁，小露事業線；轉身更是別有洞天，大露背剪裁沿著肩胛骨綴以閃亮水鑽飾邊，將她零贅肉的白滑玉背與纖細腰線一覽無遺，集純潔仙氣與火辣性感於一身。</p><p><p><img alt=\"81593029-e583-42f0-92b1-cd85d21f60c7.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026cxoKBljTRl1795415659.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"f44390a5-423f-4bff-9b98-6feaf4dfb0c0.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026IC5CIvyd9U1795415657.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>一輯靚相發布後，隨即吸引大批網民及圈中好友湧入留言區洗版激讚，紛紛大讚葉蒨文：「著白色真係好有仙氣」、「又靚又性感，完全無得輸」，一致激讚她當晚狀態大勇，氣質高貴迷人！</p><p><p><img alt=\"ed8e8fce-b6a2-440e-8179-9720f0e00593.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026rS2pevLKXt1795415658.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T07:31:53.314615+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":297,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T06:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:23.800544+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T07:25:17.597410+00:00","content_hash":"27ee825e2be9b6285d26372b4efea5ba46f7641378101c41911018932bdbbc23","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T07:31:53.314615+00:00"